OL,3,GNEWSA'Birthplace of manufacturing' mill
OL,4,Asaved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe short-term future of the oldest
OL,7,Fmill building at Cromford Mills,
OL,8,Fconsidered the birthplace of modern
OL,9,Fmanufacturing, has been safeguarded,
OL,10,Fsays Historic England.
OL,12,FThe Grade I listed Upper Mill, also
OL,13,Fknown as Building 18, has been saved
OL,14,Fand removed from the Heritage at Risk
OL,15,FRegister it was added to in 1998, it
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,FIt follows extensive works to the mill
OL,19,F- which dates back to the 1770s -
OL,20,Fincluding replacement roofing,
OL,21,Fstructural repairs and drainage works.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
